      "message": "I\u0027m not certain about the intent here?  The defines make it look like this would be a check on the AMA VDO, but the bitfield being confirmed is the UFP VDO.  Additionally, I don\u0027t see any check on the product type to verify we can use the UFP or AMA VDOs (ex. PDUSB periperhal/hub to use UFP, AMA to use AMA)",
